# Ezmerelda d'Avenir travelling with the party (docs/voice/ezmerelda.md): short lines a guest says while walking with the party, shown and voiced
# like banter (story/banter.gd). The node's name says when it may play: quest_ on entering an area while their story is
# at that point (these come first), place_ on entering an area, fight_ after a won fight, idle_ now and then on the
# road. Each plays once per playthrough, only while Ezmerelda is with the party. Every line here is unvoiced for now.

~ quest_rudolph_found
if guest:ezmerelda and region:vallaki and flag.rictavio_unmasked
interject guest:ezmerelda: Feathers. A hat full of feathers. Forty years of monographs, and he hid in a hat. I'll be laughing about that when I'm dead.
endif
-> END

~ place_tower
if guest:ezmerelda and region:van_richtens_tower
interject guest:ezmerelda: Rudolph's tower. He left it to rot and me to find it. Mind my wagon; it bites. I built half the traps myself.
endif
-> END

~ place_vallaki
if guest:ezmerelda and region:vallaki and not flag.rictavio_unmasked
interject guest:ezmerelda: A carnival wagon at the inn that nobody's allowed to open. That's a showman or a hunter. I'd like to know which.
endif
-> END

~ place_den
if guest:ezmerelda and region:werewolf_den
interject guest:ezmerelda: Werewolves. I owe them a leg. I've been meaning to settle up.
endif
-> END

~ place_abbey
if guest:ezmerelda and region:abbey_of_st_markovia
interject guest:ezmerelda: Angels don't stitch. Whatever runs this abbey, it's been practising on people.
endif
-> END

~ place_castle
if guest:ezmerelda and region:castle_ravenloft
interject guest:ezmerelda: Every hunter I ever admired walked up a hill like this one. Silver first, questions never, and nobody wanders off.
endif
-> END

~ place_tser_pool
if guest:ezmerelda and at:tser_pool
interject guest:ezmerelda: My people's wagons. They'll pretend not to know me. I left young, and they've never forgiven me for coming back taller.
endif
-> END

~ fight_vampire
if guest:ezmerelda
interject guest:ezmerelda: Say something a vampire wouldn't. Good. You're all still you.
endif
-> END

~ fight_pages
if guest:ezmerelda
interject guest:ezmerelda: Not bad. Rudolph would have written four pages on that and got the ending wrong.
endif
-> END

~ fight_bits
if guest:ezmerelda
interject guest:ezmerelda: I've lost bits of me to worse than that. Keep your bits. You'll miss them.
endif
-> END

~ idle_doors
if guest:ezmerelda
interject guest:ezmerelda: I go first through doors. Not because I'm brave. Because I've got the leg that doesn't bleed.
endif
-> END

~ idle_stopping
if guest:ezmerelda
interject guest:ezmerelda: Stopping's the one thing I'm bad at. Rudolph says it'll kill me. Rudolph says a lot, from very far away.
endif
-> END

~ idle_eva
if guest:ezmerelda
interject guest:ezmerelda: Eva dealt me into other people's games when I was six. I've stopped minding. I only wish she'd tell me the rules.
endif
-> END

~ quest_plan_catacombs
if guest:ezmerelda and flag.ezmerelda_castle_plan and at:castle_ravenloft_catacombs
interject guest:ezmerelda: The dead keep better hours than the living down here, so stay close and do not open anything I have not looked at first.
endif
-> END

~ quest_plan_tombs
if guest:ezmerelda and flag.ezmerelda_castle_plan and at:castle_ravenloft_catacombs_tombs
interject guest:ezmerelda: I hate tombs. They always have one more door than anyone's map says, and never the one you wanted.
endif
-> END
